Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:20.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:21.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Found anything good?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no such luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:27.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't do. You've got to fend for yourself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:51.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.24,0:00:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, are you sure about this?\NWe are...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looking at your skin and eyes, I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:00.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're people from Ishbal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.29,0:01:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a gathering place for \Nthose who, for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.09,0:01:06.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,cannot live in the lands of their birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:09.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got petty criminals and corrupt soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.14,0:01:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who have been found out and ousted here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laughable, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:15.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-An Ishbalan with a scar on his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.23,0:01:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard about this guy before!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:27.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:28.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait up, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:32.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for popping off\Nat you like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:42.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He merged himself with the wall?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.17,0:01:43.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:44.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I'm in a hurry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:55.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say that despite\Nbeing a State Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:57.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you have an interest in\Nthe Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:06.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.78,0:02:10.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:15.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.87,0:02:21.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:01.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ham, 100 grams, 128 cens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:03.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see someone named Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:07.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chicken breasts, 160 cens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:11.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers wouldn't have come visiting here, would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know them?\NPlease do something about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way! I don't know what that person has in mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, right now,\NEd and Al are probably in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.62,0:04:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sliced beef chuck, 200 cens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:31.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are here on military business.\NThere is no need to hide anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:35.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mixed ground beef and pork, 98 cens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:39.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Allow me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Major! Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:29.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like a friendship has been born out of their muscles, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, where are the \Ntwo of them, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:57.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:06:03.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are stories floating around about how you used your brother as an experimental subject
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:03.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and transmuted only his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:06.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or how you're being\Npursued by homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:10.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm offering to take you\Nsomeplace safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:13.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both you and your\Nfreak of a brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:17.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you say\Nhis brother was?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He really is hollow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like Tucker said!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:28.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get so upset\Nover what people say!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:39.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:40.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:45.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm magnificent as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:49.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Chimera?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.65,0:06:57.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he escaped from the 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Major! It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:02.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Lt. Colonel Archer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:07.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is in charge of the\NCourt-Martial Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:10.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you out here\Nin the countryside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:13.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Court-Martial Office?\NJust like Lt. Colonel Hughes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the Lt. Colonel doing all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:22.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you about that Chimera, as well as several other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:25.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but now is not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is starting to get interesting, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:36.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A perfect Chimera, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:38.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:07:58.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:01.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Huh?" doesn't cover it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.39,0:08:13.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come mine are different from yours, Ed and Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.23,0:08:22.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't my real arm and leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:27.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what happened to your real ones, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:33.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:37.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, do you remember\Nwhere you got this scar from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is just a coincidence after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.51,0:08:54.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, Brother, your arm and leg were \Ncarried away in an equivalent exchange, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:57.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would they be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:08:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just too weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:01.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's weird. That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:07.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you know, supposing that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:08.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my arm and leg were brought back from behind that doorway, then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:11.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your body, too, could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:19.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a close look at the sole of his right foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:26.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're getting closer to the mystery of the 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's seize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we not taking the brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got ourselves\Nan even bigger catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:34.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, have I done anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:42.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:50.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think\Nyou're doing, Major?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major, that boy doesn't have any memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:06.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've already filed a report!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:10.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's an important witness to the\Ndestructive activities that took place in Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:13.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll question him at the\NSouthern Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:14.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've seen this crest\Nbefore too, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That boy is in league\Nwith the homunculi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:31.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's connected to the persons who destroyed the 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.37,0:10:37.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:43.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric, we're going to have to retake your testimonies as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:45.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait for us at\Nyour master's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wasn't continuing this investigation prohibited by the Führer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:56.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:10:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was bitten by a fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:00.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That boy has the same scar\Non his shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:10.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, that leg of his\Ndoesn't appear to be his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:13.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that boy's arm and leg\Nare yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.45,0:11:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:17.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.\NThat's why I want to verify it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:21.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:24.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the reason why Brother and I have been struggling all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if you look into it—actually, \NI don't know how you would look into it—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:35.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if you did find out that that is your brother's arm and leg, what would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:40.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pluck them off,\Nand claim them for your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:48.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, you're better off\Nnot finding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:02.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yoki... Yoki...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard that name before somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said himself that he was once in charge of a mine in the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's true!\NIt's the honest truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:18.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:21.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.35,0:12:24.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's true, then I will inform the Führer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He would probably allow you to return to the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.65,0:12:28.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:34.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, the place they took him to was, get this, the Southern Command Center!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:37.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's great. Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Way to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget about the brothers for a while,\Nand keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:44.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sounds like the Elric brothers are just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.59,0:12:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:56.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the two of them\Nwill be of use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:13:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear that Envy and Pride and them are after them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.35,0:13:04.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so it sounded like it would be fun\Nto make off with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:08.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But thanks to them, it looks like we'll be able to come by something even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To think that there would be a homunculus with the ability to use alchemy, like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.78,0:13:19.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have to get him on my side, or things will be more troublesome down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please let me go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:22.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think this is someplace that you can just get away with haphazardly busting into?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:28.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are former soldiers, so you should understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was once posted to the\NSouthern Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:37.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go butting in where you\Naren't needed, State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.55,0:13:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, maybe we can have him at least show the other two the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:46.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, if you try to betray us...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:53.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, suit yourself. \NI just want to see some fireworks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:07.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you do with that boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, why are you so particular about that boy, anyhow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.09,0:14:18.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The military might be able to find out who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.67,0:14:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, that boy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:20.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.31,0:14:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may not believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we've met homunculi—created people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:36.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They all had powers that \Nnormal humans could not possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:42.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a mouth that could eat any kind of metal,\Nfingers that could penetrate anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the ability to\Ntransform their body at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:48.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That boy did use alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but he's still some kind of monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.34,0:14:59.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know why \Na homunculus is born?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:08.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you think that I hadn't realized what that boy was?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:36.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's been like this for that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she's so strong that\Nit always slips our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of illness is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.63,0:15:47.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's possible that the hospitals in Central might be able to cure—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:50.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it would probably be too difficult for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:52.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.85,0:15:55.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but rather than\Ntreating her in a rural hospital like this—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:57.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an incurable illness, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her organs from here \Nto about here are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.99,0:16:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:12.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like they were completely cut out from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:16.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the remaining organs are intricately linked to each other, maintaining their functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't even know how it is\Nthat she's holding on to her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:22.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:26.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It almost sounds like they were carried away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, Sensei did the\Nsame thing that we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:33.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:51.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to do anything for you before, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:56.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:17:00.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please... I don't want you to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what I'm about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:26.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sig-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:28.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Izumi-san inside there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why won't you tell me anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:37.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neither will Izumi-san\Nnor Ed nor Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:43.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:50.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She told me she was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was the one who chose to keep her from giving birth, in order to save her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:18:00.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet she told me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:06.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she was sorry that\Nshe wasn't able to give birth,\Nover and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.07,0:18:08.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:10.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I didn't know...\Nher sorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or how hard she was taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:24.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never thought she would do\Nsomething like that on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.13,0:18:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:31.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same thing\Nthat Ed and Al did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:32.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human transmutation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:36.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She tried to bring\Nthe baby back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She did everything by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.94,0:18:44.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know\Nwhat she saw there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:48.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just that when she came back,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:52.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the insides of her belly were completely gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and she said she would never\Nbe able to have children again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:19:00.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when she said that,\Nshe told me\Nshe was sorry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's up to you, mad bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:11.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I might be a little\Nshort on sulfur here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:25.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major, seize that woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:31.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's certainly festive here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:46.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:49.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please put that boy down and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.47,0:19:56.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I am still \Na dog of the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:07.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would the Führer be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.24,0:20:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That lizard bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but we have \Na slight interest in that boy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:33.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Among Sensei, the Major, \Nnot to mention these guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn. A four-way standoff, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.85,0:20:43.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's a five-way standoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.95,0:20:57.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That man just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:21:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was he not of\Nthe people of Ishbal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:02.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not approach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you not notice\Nthe tattoo on his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is a transgressor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.67,0:21:14.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has disobeyed God's teachings \Nand has been eternally cast out of Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:21.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A group of Ishbalan people, in the south, in Kishua?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:25.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is believed that\NScar is among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:27.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:34.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're moving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:38.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar is in hiding in the western slums of the city of Kishua.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:41.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he surrenders quietly,\Nthat will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.37,0:21:46.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he resists, we will take him down, along with the slum's inhabitants.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.03,0:23:40.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.74,0:23:42.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 31: "Sin"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.03,0:23:47.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give them back.\NThose belong to Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.53,0:23:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getting those back is the reason why we've been traveling!
